<?php
/**
 * Plugin Name: Caspian — Service×City Matrix
 * Description: Template-driven virtual cross-pages at /{city}-{appliance}-repair/. ACF/data-driven. 36 cities × 8 services = 288 pages generated by single template. No CPT entries created. Reuses caspian_brand_logos() for brand grid.
 * Version: 1.3
 *
 * v1.3 fixes (critical layout):
 *   - v1.2 shared full-bleed selector (applied to 8 sections individually) caused
 *     the entire page to collapse into the left half of the viewport — Astra was
 *     defaulting virtual-render pages to a sidebar layout, and per-section -50vw
 *     margins clipped against the narrow content container.
 *   - Refactored: full-bleed is now applied to ONLY the outer .caspian-matrix-page
 *     wrapper (single anchor point). Inner sections flow naturally at 100% width.
 *   - Added Astra layout filters to force no-sidebar + page-builder layout for
 *     matrix renders. Also belts-and-suspenders body classes.
 *
 * v1.2 fixes:
 *   - Call buttons now display "Call Now" (phone number hidden, but stays in tel: href).
 *     Matches header CTA pattern site-wide.
 *   - All sections (hero, symptoms, local, why, brands, faq, links, cta-final) now
 *     full-bleed via shared selector — was previously hero-only. Preserves site
 *     design harmony: dark sections (cta-final, why) now span full viewport.
 *
 * v1.1 fix:
 *   - Removed virtual-post hack (setup_postdata + $wp_query fake post) — was triggering fatal
 *     incompat with Yoast/Astra causing HTTP 500 on render.
 *   - Switched to direct render at template_redirect: get_header + echo render + get_footer + exit.
 *     Same pattern as standalone brand pages.
 *   - Added try/catch around render with error_log + graceful fallback message.
 *   - Document title now set via pre_get_document_title + document_title_parts filters.
 *
 * Architecture:
 *   - Single rewrite rule with explicit service alternation -> captures (city, service) tuple
 *   - Virtual post fabricated at template_redirect (no DB entries)
 *   - Astra header/footer + the_content filter pipeline -> consistent layout with rest of site
 *   - Yoast wpseo_title + wpseo_metadesc filters per cross-page
 *   - FAQ schema injected at wp_head
 *   - Locked design system (Royal Sapphire palette)
 *
 * URL examples (all 288 work):
 *   /hamilton-refrigerator-repair/
 *   /burlington-washing-machine-repair/
 *   /toronto-dishwasher-repair/
 *   /oakville-gas-appliance-repair/
 *   /stoney-creek-dryer-repair/
 *   /richmond-hill-oven-repair/
 */

if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) exit;

